        Source FCA60 SNOMED CT 259381000000100 = Resection of aortic root and ascending aorta with
        reimplantation of coronary arteries using valved conduit prosthesis (Bentall-type procedure).
        Target. Source describes a specific extended Bentall procedure; target is the SNOMED CT parent for
        aortic root replacement. Broader. Moderate tier: target covers the core procedure but loses the
        valved-conduit and ascending-aorta detail.
        """
}
